                                                "example_id": "f1555f62-d385-4977-a545-3277c1216bf9",
                                                "sense_id": "a4605cdd-c851-31e8-8f38-14c318689cfc",
                                                "text": "There's irony in three of the greatest experts in robotics in the world falling into the same elementary trap, isn't there?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7ccc91e-8f24-40b0-bfb1-17f10d696479",
                                                "sense_id": "a4605cdd-c851-31e8-8f38-14c318689cfc",
                                                "text": "While it may take another five to 10 years for humanoid robots to make a real societal impact, they could eventually become the next widely adopted consumer electronics, according to Xi Ning, chair professor of robotics and automation at the University of Hong Kong."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
